00:12:10.987 --> 00:12:12.084
I think women should be able to

00:12:12.084 --> 00:12:13.827
express themselves however they like.

00:12:13.827 --> 00:12:15.203
I mean, I think that's feminism,

00:12:15.203 --> 00:12:17.443
taking pride in your body,
taking pride in your work,

00:12:17.443 --> 00:12:18.988
and doing whatever you want.

00:12:18.988 --> 00:12:20.737
